.TH LINK-AUDIT 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
link-audit \- report dangling and unresolved symbolic links
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B link-audit
.RB [ --all ]
.RB [ --one-file-system ]
.RB [ --null ]
.I DIRECTORY
.br
.B link-audit
.RB [ --help | --version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists symbolic links with dangling targets, resolution loops or an otherwise
unresolved target. The scan does not modify links and never traverses symbolic
link directories. A stat operation does resolve each symlink target for checking.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --all
Also show valid links.
.TP
.B --one-file-system
Do not descend into other devices.
.TP
.B --null
Emit NUL-terminated STATUS, PATH, TARGET fields without summary.
.TP
.BR --help , --version
Display help or version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 complete scan; 1 incomplete scan or unresolved target status;
2 usage error; 3 required library missing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR find (1),
.BR readlink (1)
